1
00:01:37,539 --> 00:01:42,930
[Spring of The Blade]

2
00:01:43,330 --> 00:01:46,020
[Episode 26]

3
00:01:53,840 --> 00:01:54,870
My Lady,

4
00:01:55,200 --> 00:01:57,430
the Heir hasn't touched his bow in days.

5
00:01:57,560 --> 00:02:00,160
There's no need
to restring it for him anymore.

6
00:02:02,760 --> 00:02:03,510
Luzhui.

7
00:02:05,200 --> 00:02:06,200
Do you remember

8
00:02:07,640 --> 00:02:08,280
how old we were

9
00:02:08,280 --> 00:02:10,430
when I first

10
00:02:10,800 --> 00:02:11,870
met Chunzhi?

11
00:02:14,680 --> 00:02:15,800
He had just started

12
00:02:15,800 --> 00:02:17,460
learning horseback archery.

13
00:02:17,870 --> 00:02:19,000
Every arrow he shot

14
00:02:19,360 --> 00:02:20,800
hit the bullseye.

15
00:02:21,190 --> 00:02:22,430
I remember thinking,

16
00:02:23,240 --> 00:02:25,710
how could there be
such a spirited young man?

17
00:02:26,520 --> 00:02:28,180
It was as if he were the only one

18
00:02:28,360 --> 00:02:30,430
in all of Hengtang who was shining.

19
00:02:32,800 --> 00:02:34,910
So you've been in love with the Heir

20
00:02:35,310 --> 00:02:36,470
since then?

21
00:02:41,000 --> 00:02:42,200
Before I got married,

22
00:02:42,630 --> 00:02:45,190
I was always trailing after him,

23
00:02:45,400 --> 00:02:46,870
calling him Chunzhi.

24
00:02:47,560 --> 00:02:50,360
My greatest wish since childhood
was to marry him.

25
00:02:51,030 --> 00:02:53,280
It felt like it was destined.

26
00:02:54,000 --> 00:02:56,120
I thought Chunzhi was mine.

27
00:02:58,560 --> 00:03:00,690
And he was always good to me, actually.

28
00:03:01,240 --> 00:03:02,400
He'd have gifts

29
00:03:02,710 --> 00:03:04,240
ready for me every holiday,

30
00:03:04,430 --> 00:03:06,590
and he'd gently call me Second Sister.

31
00:03:07,430 --> 00:03:08,960
Whenever he traveled far,

32
00:03:08,960 --> 00:03:11,890
he'd always bring back
little gifts to make me happy.

33
00:03:12,750 --> 00:03:14,590
He was always so considerate.

34
00:03:17,840 --> 00:03:18,800
But I know

35
00:03:20,630 --> 00:03:21,870
this marriage

36
00:03:23,280 --> 00:03:24,480
is something I stole.

37
00:03:26,150 --> 00:03:27,750
He may resent me

38
00:03:28,310 --> 00:03:29,770
for a very, very long time.

39
00:03:38,870 --> 00:03:39,870
But I got to marry

40
00:03:40,400 --> 00:03:41,710
the man I'd admired

41
00:03:41,710 --> 00:03:43,240
since I was a child anyway.

42
00:03:45,560 --> 00:03:46,400
But he

43
00:03:48,870 --> 00:03:50,470
could only watch helplessly

44
00:03:54,560 --> 00:03:56,079
as his beloved

45
00:03:57,470 --> 00:03:59,000
married someone else.

46
00:04:03,590 --> 00:04:05,320
If he holds a grudge against me,

47
00:04:05,750 --> 00:04:06,960
I deserve it.

48
00:04:09,840 --> 00:04:11,560
It's the price I chose to pay.

49
00:04:14,590 --> 00:04:15,750
I don't blame him.

50
00:04:18,390 --> 00:04:19,480
I will bear it.

51
00:04:26,360 --> 00:04:27,430
I only want him...

52
00:04:30,070 --> 00:04:32,270
to be the spirited young man he once was,

53
00:04:33,310 --> 00:04:34,680
bow in hand,

54
00:04:36,630 --> 00:04:38,560
riding tall and proud.

55
00:04:54,870 --> 00:04:55,630
My Lady.

56
00:05:00,240 --> 00:05:01,950
Keep this bow for me.

57
00:05:03,680 --> 00:05:04,610
I firmly believe

58
00:05:06,560 --> 00:05:07,560
that Chunzhi

59
00:05:08,870 --> 00:05:10,870
will pull himself together one day.

60
00:05:14,040 --> 00:05:17,360
"With wine, we sing.

61
00:05:17,360 --> 00:05:20,310
How brief is life?

62
00:05:20,310 --> 00:05:21,630
Like morning dew, fleeting and gone.

63
00:05:21,630 --> 00:05:23,730
So much time has slipped away."

64
00:05:24,720 --> 00:05:25,430
Marquis.

65
00:05:25,800 --> 00:05:27,040
Commissioner Hu.

66
00:05:27,040 --> 00:05:28,970
Long time no see. How have you been?

67
00:05:29,390 --> 00:05:30,360
Very well.

68
00:05:30,360 --> 00:05:31,270
Thank you. Come on.

69
00:05:31,270 --> 00:05:31,930
Have a seat.

70
00:05:32,040 --> 00:05:32,750
Please.

71
00:05:33,630 --> 00:05:34,190
Marquis,

72
00:05:34,310 --> 00:05:35,950
you're just as punctual

73
00:05:36,270 --> 00:05:38,480
as ever.

74
00:05:38,870 --> 00:05:40,720
I'm old now. Unlike you.

75
00:05:40,920 --> 00:05:42,480
You are busy
with official business all day.

76
00:05:42,480 --> 00:05:44,750
I have nothing to do anyway.

77
00:05:45,720 --> 00:05:46,680
So when you invited me,

78
00:05:46,680 --> 00:05:47,830
of course

79
00:05:48,310 --> 00:05:49,800
I came right on time.

80
00:05:51,630 --> 00:05:52,390
Marquis,

81
00:05:53,159 --> 00:05:54,630
you've shut yourself away for so long.

82
00:05:54,630 --> 00:05:56,430
I thought inviting you out

83
00:05:56,630 --> 00:05:58,310
would take quite some effort.

84
00:05:58,750 --> 00:06:00,040
But you came at once.

85
00:06:00,270 --> 00:06:02,070
I must admit, that surprised me.

86
00:06:03,240 --> 00:06:04,640
Looks like you're really

87
00:06:05,190 --> 00:06:06,750
doing me a favor.

88
00:06:07,720 --> 00:06:08,510
Commissioner Hu,

89
00:06:08,510 --> 00:06:10,560
things are different now.

90
00:06:10,870 --> 00:06:12,160
You're in the capital,

91
00:06:12,160 --> 00:06:15,680
while I'm still here
in this little Hengtang.

92
00:06:15,870 --> 00:06:17,160
Our positions are no longer the same.

93
00:06:17,160 --> 00:06:18,310
So when you invited me,

94
00:06:18,310 --> 00:06:20,830
I naturally came as fast as I could.

95
00:06:21,600 --> 00:06:22,390
Here, Marquis.

96
00:06:22,390 --> 00:06:23,000
Please.

97
00:06:24,920 --> 00:06:27,040
There isn't poison in this wine, is there?

98
00:06:27,040 --> 00:06:29,240
You must be joking, Marquis.

99
00:06:30,270 --> 00:06:31,310
I'll drink first.

100
00:06:31,310 --> 00:06:31,920
Alright.

101
00:06:39,120 --> 00:06:39,870
Good wine.

102
00:06:40,159 --> 00:06:41,120
Good food!

103
00:06:41,630 --> 00:06:43,510
If you eat this every day,
Commissioner Hu,

104
00:06:43,510 --> 00:06:45,159
you're really lucky.

105
00:06:47,870 --> 00:06:48,720
Marquis.

106
00:06:49,750 --> 00:06:50,600
If

107
00:06:50,870 --> 00:06:52,870
you like the food my chefs cook,

108
00:06:53,560 --> 00:06:54,480
I will order them

109
00:06:54,480 --> 00:06:55,880
to cook for you every day.

110
00:06:56,240 --> 00:06:57,750
If you like my wine,

111
00:06:58,310 --> 00:07:00,040
you can have as much as you want.

112
00:07:00,310 --> 00:07:01,070
I am old.

113
00:07:01,190 --> 00:07:01,950
I can't eat

114
00:07:01,950 --> 00:07:03,000
or drink much anymore.

115
00:07:03,000 --> 00:07:03,680
However...

116
00:07:05,310 --> 00:07:05,920
Marquis,

117
00:07:07,430 --> 00:07:09,000
you have to do me a favor.

118
00:07:09,800 --> 00:07:10,530
I'm all ears.

119
00:07:11,480 --> 00:07:12,950
I suppose you've heard.

120
00:07:13,870 --> 00:07:14,630
Right now,

121
00:07:15,360 --> 00:07:16,800
these students,

122
00:07:16,800 --> 00:07:18,310
incited by others,

123
00:07:18,720 --> 00:07:20,190
have been speaking recklessly

124
00:07:20,190 --> 00:07:21,560
and writing inflammatory articles.

125
00:07:21,560 --> 00:07:24,160
And they seem to be gathering
in large numbers.

126
00:07:24,630 --> 00:07:25,310
Marquis,

127
00:07:26,190 --> 00:07:27,720
I'd like to ask you to step in

128
00:07:28,190 --> 00:07:30,510
and help me keep things under control.

129
00:07:31,240 --> 00:07:32,360
You still command

130
00:07:32,680 --> 00:07:34,240
great respect in Hengtang.

131
00:07:34,720 --> 00:07:36,950
Your standing here
hasn't diminished at all.

132
00:07:36,950 --> 00:07:39,240
All you need to do is calm them down.

133
00:07:40,040 --> 00:07:41,240
Once this is settled,

134
00:07:43,040 --> 00:07:44,000
I promise that

135
00:07:44,480 --> 00:07:46,409
as far as the capital is concerned,

136
00:07:46,870 --> 00:07:49,800
you'll always be the Marquis of Danyang
in Hengtang.

137
00:07:53,360 --> 00:07:54,600
Commissioner Hu,

138
00:07:54,800 --> 00:07:56,830
how am I supposed to help you with this?

139
00:07:56,830 --> 00:07:57,800
I'm

140
00:07:57,800 --> 00:07:58,600
old now.

141
00:07:58,870 --> 00:08:00,070
No one

142
00:08:00,160 --> 00:08:01,420
listens to me anymore.

143
00:08:02,510 --> 00:08:03,600
Back then,

144
00:08:03,830 --> 00:08:05,640
when you were in Hengtang,

145
00:08:05,720 --> 00:08:06,830
you were just

146
00:08:07,160 --> 00:08:08,620
a low-ranking inspector.

147
00:08:08,750 --> 00:08:10,120
Whenever someone came from the capital,

148
00:08:10,120 --> 00:08:12,430
you'd wait on the sidelines
and play along.

149
00:08:12,430 --> 00:08:13,430
I remember

150
00:08:13,720 --> 00:08:14,870
it was right here,

151
00:08:15,870 --> 00:08:16,870
in that corner.

152
00:08:17,510 --> 00:08:19,510
You were sitting way off to the side,

153
00:08:19,950 --> 00:08:21,940
watching everyone's reactions,

154
00:08:22,270 --> 00:08:24,240
looking for someone
who could be useful to you,

155
00:08:24,240 --> 00:08:26,800
someone who could help you
rise through the ranks.

156
00:08:26,800 --> 00:08:28,390
And your efforts paid off!

157
00:08:28,390 --> 00:08:30,190
You actually found one.

158
00:08:31,680 --> 00:08:33,909
Eunuch Xia, who the late Emperor sent here

159
00:08:33,909 --> 00:08:35,360
to run errands.

160
00:08:36,750 --> 00:08:37,870
From then on,

161
00:08:37,870 --> 00:08:39,120
you've been going around

162
00:08:39,120 --> 00:08:42,080
gathering dirt on officials.

163
00:08:42,390 --> 00:08:44,049
You remember that, don't you?

164
00:08:44,150 --> 00:08:45,670
That Shen Zhibai

165
00:08:46,200 --> 00:08:47,530
you wrongfully accused

166
00:08:49,550 --> 00:08:51,200
was killed by you.

167
00:08:52,480 --> 00:08:55,610
In doing so, you eliminated
a major threat to Eunuch Xia!

168
00:08:55,870 --> 00:08:57,030
And Eunuch Xia

169
00:08:57,550 --> 00:08:59,000
was pleased about it.

170
00:08:59,550 --> 00:09:00,750
A few years later,

171
00:09:01,000 --> 00:09:01,880
you...

172
00:09:02,390 --> 00:09:03,450
went to the capital

173
00:09:03,840 --> 00:09:06,870
and rose through the ranks all the way
to where you are now!

174
00:09:06,870 --> 00:09:09,360
Years later, you killed his son,

175
00:09:09,750 --> 00:09:11,670
Shen Run, too.

176
00:09:12,750 --> 00:09:13,510
Right?

177
00:09:15,480 --> 00:09:16,960
Just look at Hengtang now.

178
00:09:18,960 --> 00:09:21,420
It's practically become your own backyard.

179
00:09:21,960 --> 00:09:23,360
As for my military power,

180
00:09:23,870 --> 00:09:24,960
if you want it,

181
00:09:25,240 --> 00:09:26,000
just take it.

182
00:09:26,000 --> 00:09:27,600
I'll hand it over willingly!

183
00:09:30,030 --> 00:09:31,030
Commissioner Hu,

184
00:09:31,270 --> 00:09:32,270
back then,

185
00:09:35,000 --> 00:09:36,720
I really underestimated you.

186
00:09:40,030 --> 00:09:40,870
Marquis.

187
00:09:45,360 --> 00:09:46,600
Looks like

188
00:09:47,600 --> 00:09:48,790
you've made up your mind

189
00:09:48,790 --> 00:09:50,750
not to give me face today.

190
00:09:52,550 --> 00:09:55,600
You're even bringing up
things from a lifetime ago.

191
00:09:56,360 --> 00:09:57,420
If that's the case,

192
00:09:58,360 --> 00:09:59,870
let me remind you.

193
00:10:00,870 --> 00:10:01,720
Please go ahead.

194
00:10:01,720 --> 00:10:03,840
As for the Shen Zhibai case,

195
00:10:04,030 --> 00:10:06,790
it was the late Emperor who ordered you

196
00:10:07,150 --> 00:10:08,550
to investigate it.

197
00:10:08,960 --> 00:10:09,670
Yes.

198
00:10:10,360 --> 00:10:13,440
The evidence in that case was conclusive,

199
00:10:13,510 --> 00:10:14,910
and everyone told the same story.

200
00:10:14,910 --> 00:10:16,910
What could I have done?

201
00:10:17,910 --> 00:10:20,640
When the late Emperor
sent me to handle that case,

202
00:10:20,840 --> 00:10:21,750
he was only

203
00:10:21,750 --> 00:10:23,480
going through the motions.

204
00:10:23,720 --> 00:10:24,790
It's just a pity.

205
00:10:25,550 --> 00:10:28,390
A pity about Shen Zhibai.

206
00:10:29,870 --> 00:10:32,080
Back when you were young and ambitious,

207
00:10:33,720 --> 00:10:36,670
you knew better than
to put yourself in danger.

208
00:10:37,390 --> 00:10:38,510
You could even

209
00:10:39,510 --> 00:10:41,200
let us off the hook.

210
00:10:42,120 --> 00:10:43,360
After that case,

211
00:10:43,790 --> 00:10:47,550
you stayed behind the scenes for years,

212
00:10:47,870 --> 00:10:49,670
keeping a tight grip on the army.

213
00:10:49,870 --> 00:10:51,870
You were afraid we'd infiltrate it.

214
00:10:52,790 --> 00:10:54,720
What a smart man.

215
00:10:55,720 --> 00:10:58,120
You could act like that
when you were young.

216
00:10:58,510 --> 00:11:00,510
So how is it that now, in your old age,

217
00:11:01,000 --> 00:11:02,440
you can't let this go?

218
00:11:09,440 --> 00:11:10,440
Commissioner Hu.

219
00:11:13,360 --> 00:11:14,720
Back then,

220
00:11:15,910 --> 00:11:18,080
I was forced by circumstances.

221
00:11:20,150 --> 00:11:22,870
All the officials in Hengtang,
big and small,

222
00:11:24,320 --> 00:11:26,000
had become your men.

223
00:11:26,550 --> 00:11:28,360
That case of Shen Zhibai,

224
00:11:29,720 --> 00:11:31,790
you handled it flawlessly.

225
00:11:33,480 --> 00:11:35,240
Shen Zhibai led a faction

226
00:11:35,630 --> 00:11:37,360
of upright officials

227
00:11:37,510 --> 00:11:40,030
and pushed hard for the new policies,

228
00:11:40,440 --> 00:11:43,570
clashing with Eunuch Xia and his faction
time and again.

229
00:11:43,670 --> 00:11:45,080
Eunuch Xia

230
00:11:45,600 --> 00:11:47,530
had spent years building his power

231
00:11:48,120 --> 00:11:49,390
in the court,

232
00:11:50,510 --> 00:11:52,790
and no one could shake him.

233
00:11:53,440 --> 00:11:54,790
As for the late Emperor,

234
00:11:55,240 --> 00:11:56,970
he could never make up his mind.

235
00:11:57,240 --> 00:11:58,150
And I

236
00:11:58,550 --> 00:12:00,960
could only stand by and watch,

237
00:12:03,510 --> 00:12:05,390
making sure the troops in Hengtang

238
00:12:05,390 --> 00:12:06,750
stayed in order.

239
00:12:10,200 --> 00:12:11,320
What a pity.

240
00:12:12,240 --> 00:12:13,440
I failed to find

241
00:12:14,240 --> 00:12:16,550
a way out for Shen Zhibai,

242
00:12:17,200 --> 00:12:19,510
nor did I persuade the late Emperor

243
00:12:21,960 --> 00:12:23,560
to support the new policies.

244
00:12:32,630 --> 00:12:34,000
You...

245
00:12:34,720 --> 00:12:35,670
Oh, you.

246
00:12:37,000 --> 00:12:39,600
You're just like that dead Shen Zhibai.

247
00:12:40,480 --> 00:12:42,320
Neither of you ever knew

248
00:12:42,320 --> 00:12:44,150
who your real enemy was.

249
00:12:45,030 --> 00:12:46,360
Do you really think

250
00:12:46,360 --> 00:12:48,550
I was your only enemy?

251
00:12:52,510 --> 00:12:54,170
From Hengtang to the capital,

252
00:12:54,630 --> 00:12:57,440
how many people wanted Shen Zhibai dead?

253
00:12:58,000 --> 00:12:59,200
Do you know why?

254
00:12:59,750 --> 00:13:01,910
That so-called political turmoil

255
00:13:02,670 --> 00:13:03,840
was tied to

256
00:13:04,120 --> 00:13:06,910
the very foundation
of Jiangnan's tax revenue.

257
00:13:07,480 --> 00:13:08,910
Once this was tampered with,

258
00:13:08,910 --> 00:13:11,000
the whole system would've been thrown

259
00:13:11,000 --> 00:13:11,960
into chaos.

260
00:13:13,910 --> 00:13:15,510
Do you think the late Emperor

261
00:13:15,510 --> 00:13:17,150
would sit by and watch

262
00:13:17,360 --> 00:13:19,490
Jiangnan's coffers become unstable?

263
00:13:26,750 --> 00:13:27,630
The wine—

264
00:13:28,440 --> 00:13:29,700
if you can't finish it,

265
00:13:30,670 --> 00:13:32,200
don't force yourself.

266
00:13:37,790 --> 00:13:40,080
You've stayed behind closed doors
for years.

267
00:13:40,080 --> 00:13:41,680
On the surface, it looks like

268
00:13:42,670 --> 00:13:44,530
you've withdrawn from the world.

269
00:13:45,000 --> 00:13:45,790
In truth,

270
00:13:46,510 --> 00:13:48,240
you don't want anyone to know

271
00:13:48,870 --> 00:13:49,530
that you...

272
00:13:50,270 --> 00:13:50,750
are ill!

273
00:13:54,200 --> 00:13:56,730
A wise bird
chooses the right tree to perch in.

274
00:13:58,000 --> 00:14:01,510
Birds don't wait for a dead tree to fall
before they fly away.

275
00:14:02,360 --> 00:14:04,200
The generals under your command

276
00:14:04,840 --> 00:14:06,200
have already

277
00:14:06,630 --> 00:14:08,290
secretly reported this to me.

278
00:14:09,790 --> 00:14:10,440
However,

279
00:14:11,000 --> 00:14:12,330
you needn't blame them.

280
00:14:12,910 --> 00:14:14,110
If anyone's to blame,

281
00:14:15,910 --> 00:14:18,550
blame your useless heir.

282
00:14:19,270 --> 00:14:20,150
Your soldiers

283
00:14:20,150 --> 00:14:21,600
saw no ability in him

284
00:14:21,750 --> 00:14:24,390
to take charge of what lies ahead!

285
00:14:26,000 --> 00:14:26,790
However,

286
00:14:28,320 --> 00:14:29,390
you won't know

287
00:14:30,630 --> 00:14:31,560
what will happen

288
00:14:32,150 --> 00:14:33,080
in the future.

289
00:14:34,200 --> 00:14:35,200
Commissioner Hu.

290
00:14:37,510 --> 00:14:38,670
I have tried my best

291
00:14:39,480 --> 00:14:41,000
to stop you.

292
00:14:43,150 --> 00:14:43,960
There's...

293
00:14:45,960 --> 00:14:47,670
no need to say more.

294
00:14:57,550 --> 00:14:58,240
Guards.

295
00:15:00,750 --> 00:15:03,000
Send the Marquis on his way.

296
00:15:11,630 --> 00:15:14,440
"With wine, we sing.

297
00:15:14,440 --> 00:15:17,750
How brief is life?

298
00:15:17,750 --> 00:15:18,910
Like morning dew, fleeting and gone.

299
00:15:18,910 --> 00:15:20,600
So much time has slipped away.

300
00:15:20,600 --> 00:15:22,630
Sing with passion,

301
00:15:22,630 --> 00:15:25,080
yet the deep sorrow is hard to forget.

302
00:15:25,080 --> 00:15:27,120
How to relieve this sorrow?

303
00:15:27,120 --> 00:15:28,910
Only with...

304
00:15:29,390 --> 00:15:33,480
good wine!"

305
00:15:41,810 --> 00:15:49,810
[Zhongwu Hall]

306
00:15:44,200 --> 00:15:45,120
Chunzhi.

307
00:15:46,270 --> 00:15:49,720
There is one thing
I hope you will always remember.

308
00:15:50,240 --> 00:15:52,120
Even without your parents,

309
00:15:52,870 --> 00:15:54,960
without the title of Marquis,

310
00:15:56,030 --> 00:15:57,690
and without the Danyang Army,

311
00:15:58,150 --> 00:15:59,480
as long as you're alive,

312
00:15:59,870 --> 00:16:02,870
you can still help those you want to help.

313
00:16:03,840 --> 00:16:05,440
As long as you're still here,

314
00:16:06,750 --> 00:16:09,080
as long as you want to get back
on your feet,

315
00:16:09,960 --> 00:16:12,560
that's the last trump card
your father has left

316
00:16:13,320 --> 00:16:15,440
for Hengtang.

317
00:16:19,440 --> 00:16:20,080
Father.

318
00:16:21,240 --> 00:16:21,840
I feel...

319
00:16:23,550 --> 00:16:25,150
you are different from usual.

320
00:16:25,150 --> 00:16:26,480
Are you feeling unwell?

321
00:16:28,550 --> 00:16:29,360
No.

322
00:16:32,270 --> 00:16:33,240
Chunzhi,

323
00:16:35,510 --> 00:16:39,440
I'm leaving the Marquis's household
to you and Qingru.

324
00:16:50,910 --> 00:16:52,080
And Hengtang...

325
00:17:00,910 --> 00:17:02,480
as well.

326
00:17:07,550 --> 00:17:08,160
Yes,

327
00:17:09,510 --> 00:17:10,109
Father.

328
00:17:14,750 --> 00:17:15,720
How long will this world

329
00:17:15,720 --> 00:17:17,160
remain so unfair?

330
00:17:17,550 --> 00:17:18,960
His Lordship died unjustly.

331
00:17:18,960 --> 00:17:21,270
Hengtang has lost
its last bit of conscience!

332
00:17:21,270 --> 00:17:22,640
Eternal glory to His Lordship.

333
00:17:22,640 --> 00:17:23,200
We

334
00:17:23,440 --> 00:17:25,109
shall follow his heroic spirit!

335
00:17:25,109 --> 00:17:27,440
We absolutely cannot just sit
and wait for death!

336
00:17:27,440 --> 00:17:28,550
Now, more than ever,

337
00:17:28,550 --> 00:17:30,200
we must stand together!

338
00:17:30,440 --> 00:17:33,040
We swear to kill the traitors
of Xia's faction!

339
00:17:33,160 --> 00:17:35,400
We swear to kill the traitors
of Xia's faction!

340
00:17:35,400 --> 00:17:37,680
We swear to kill the traitors
of Xia's faction!

341
00:17:37,680 --> 00:17:38,880
Avenge His Lordship!

342
00:17:39,030 --> 00:17:40,540
We must not let Hu Xing get away!

343
00:17:40,540 --> 00:17:42,140
Avenge His Lordship!

344
00:17:42,160 --> 00:17:44,120
Avenge His Lordship!

345
00:17:44,140 --> 00:17:46,890
Avenge His Lordship!

346
00:17:46,920 --> 00:17:48,900
Avenge His Lordship!

347
00:17:48,920 --> 00:17:50,390
Avenge His Lordship!

348
00:17:50,420 --> 00:17:51,890
Avenge His Lordship!

349
00:17:51,920 --> 00:17:53,370
Avenge His Lordship!

350
00:17:53,500 --> 00:17:57,160
[Qinyue Corridor]

351
00:17:57,230 --> 00:18:02,120
[Danyue Pavilion]

352
00:18:49,640 --> 00:18:54,140
[A few days ago]

353
00:18:51,200 --> 00:18:51,730
Brother,

354
00:18:52,110 --> 00:18:53,550
you didn't explain in detail

355
00:18:53,550 --> 00:18:55,280
what else we need for this plan.

356
00:18:55,400 --> 00:18:56,800
His Majesty's intention

357
00:18:57,000 --> 00:18:58,240
in sending us back to Hengtang

358
00:18:58,240 --> 00:18:59,790
was for us to join forces with Xie Shu

359
00:18:59,790 --> 00:19:01,050
and bring Hu Xing down.

360
00:19:01,200 --> 00:19:02,600
But I discovered long ago

361
00:19:02,750 --> 00:19:04,010
that Xie Shu and Hu Xing

362
00:19:04,200 --> 00:19:05,480
had already joined forces

363
00:19:05,480 --> 00:19:06,810
and were firmly united.

364
00:19:07,110 --> 00:19:09,110
Xie Shu appears to ally with me
on the surface,

365
00:19:09,110 --> 00:19:11,680
but secretly he's in league with Hu Xing.

366
00:19:11,920 --> 00:19:13,070
Now we're in the open

367
00:19:13,070 --> 00:19:14,030
while he's in the shadows,

368
00:19:14,030 --> 00:19:15,960
putting us at a serious disadvantage.

369
00:19:15,960 --> 00:19:17,290
To break this deadlock,

370
00:19:17,440 --> 00:19:18,970
we need an unexpected move.

371
00:19:19,200 --> 00:19:20,600
We need to fake his death.

372
00:19:20,920 --> 00:19:23,120
If they believe Shen Run is really dead,

373
00:19:23,240 --> 00:19:25,200
they'll surely grow reckless
and make their move.

374
00:19:25,200 --> 00:19:26,270
Then we'll be in the shadows

375
00:19:26,270 --> 00:19:27,160
and they will be in the open.

376
00:19:27,160 --> 00:19:28,240
We'll use a retreat to gain the upper hand

377
00:19:28,240 --> 00:19:29,700
and seize their lifeline.

378
00:19:29,880 --> 00:19:31,590
But now Hengtang is united.

379
00:19:32,030 --> 00:19:33,760
How do we seize their lifeline?

380
00:19:34,480 --> 00:19:36,080
That's where you two come in.

381
00:19:36,550 --> 00:19:37,240
Hengtang

382
00:19:37,550 --> 00:19:39,270
doesn't belong to the noble families.

383
00:19:39,270 --> 00:19:40,310
No matter how many noble families
there are,

384
00:19:40,310 --> 00:19:41,720
they're still outnumbered
by the common people.

385
00:19:41,720 --> 00:19:43,200
Since Hu Xing returned,

386
00:19:43,920 --> 00:19:46,160
the officials and noble families
have exploited the people even more,

387
00:19:46,160 --> 00:19:48,640
causing
the number of landless refugees to soar.

388
00:19:48,640 --> 00:19:51,370
Those refugees
should have been their lifeline,

389
00:19:51,640 --> 00:19:54,100
yet in their eyes,
they're nothing but dust.

390
00:19:55,200 --> 00:19:55,960
I want you two

391
00:19:57,310 --> 00:19:59,240
to gather that dust into one force.

392
00:19:59,480 --> 00:20:00,480
Together with me,

393
00:20:00,640 --> 00:20:02,170
we'll set Hengtang ablaze.

394
00:20:03,400 --> 00:20:04,130
Understood.

395
00:20:05,440 --> 00:20:06,880
We'll leave the city tonight,

396
00:20:06,880 --> 00:20:08,610
pretending to go sightseeing.

397
00:20:09,000 --> 00:20:10,030
Once we're outside the city,

398
00:20:10,030 --> 00:20:11,160
we'll sneak back in.

399
00:20:11,310 --> 00:20:12,750
Once we've organized the refugees,

400
00:20:12,750 --> 00:20:14,350
we'll contact you in secret.

401
00:20:17,030 --> 00:20:17,640
Alright.

402
00:20:18,270 --> 00:20:20,070
Now there is only one thing left—

403
00:20:20,680 --> 00:20:22,280
to make my death convincing.

404
00:20:22,720 --> 00:20:24,030
The more real, the better.

405
00:20:24,030 --> 00:20:24,830
Che,

406
00:20:25,960 --> 00:20:26,920
I want you

407
00:20:28,000 --> 00:20:28,750
to stab me.

408
00:20:31,830 --> 00:20:33,030
To fool the coroner,

409
00:20:33,200 --> 00:20:35,590
the wound
has to be in exactly the right place

410
00:20:35,590 --> 00:20:37,350
to look fatal.

411
00:20:40,440 --> 00:20:42,440
But even if it's not actually fatal,

412
00:20:42,510 --> 00:20:44,510
you'll still be seriously injured.

413
00:20:44,790 --> 00:20:45,850
Don't worry, dear.

414
00:20:46,440 --> 00:20:47,110
I can

415
00:20:47,680 --> 00:20:48,590
take it.

416
00:20:51,550 --> 00:20:52,350
Brother,

417
00:20:53,000 --> 00:20:54,130
I can't bring myself

418
00:20:54,350 --> 00:20:55,400
to do it.

419
00:20:55,920 --> 00:20:57,580
I'm afraid I'll miss the mark.

420
00:21:01,680 --> 00:21:02,400
My Lord.

421
00:21:03,350 --> 00:21:06,010
We... We can't bring ourselves
to do it anymore.

422
00:21:07,830 --> 00:21:08,590
Then who...

423
00:21:09,440 --> 00:21:10,480
will do it?

424
00:21:10,790 --> 00:21:11,350
I will!

425
00:21:12,790 --> 00:21:13,880
I heard everything

426
00:21:13,900 --> 00:21:15,720
you said to your wife about Lord Shen's

427
00:21:15,720 --> 00:21:16,720
dying wish today.

428
00:21:17,070 --> 00:21:19,600
Every word echoed
what I think and what I want.

429
00:21:20,160 --> 00:21:21,920
I used to think
breaking the noble families' monopoly

430
00:21:21,920 --> 00:21:24,070
and bringing prosperity to the people
was nothing but an empty promise.

431
00:21:24,070 --> 00:21:26,510
But now, it seems we may actually
have a chance to make it happen.

432
00:21:26,510 --> 00:21:29,070
Before, I was just bound
by the imperial order.

433
00:21:29,070 --> 00:21:32,070
I didn't really want to
make things difficult for you.

434
00:21:34,110 --> 00:21:34,640
Feng En.

435
00:21:35,720 --> 00:21:37,320
I understand your concerns.

436
00:21:37,960 --> 00:21:38,690
Don't worry.

437
00:21:39,110 --> 00:21:40,350
After I fake my death,

438
00:21:40,640 --> 00:21:42,160
I'll go straight to the capital

439
00:21:42,160 --> 00:21:44,360
and explain everything to His Majesty.

440
00:21:45,400 --> 00:21:46,200
Rest assured.

441
00:21:46,550 --> 00:21:48,510
Even if His Majesty insists
on punishing me,

442
00:21:48,510 --> 00:21:50,270
I'll accept the punishment willingly.

443
00:21:50,270 --> 00:21:52,070
We risked our lives and fought our way

444
00:21:52,070 --> 00:21:53,720
through the bloodshed
on the Northern Frontier,

445
00:21:53,720 --> 00:21:55,400
with our blades pointed at the enemy.

446
00:21:55,400 --> 00:21:58,050
And now you're fighting corrupt officials.

447
00:21:58,440 --> 00:21:59,680
How could I possibly bring myself to be

448
00:21:59,680 --> 00:22:01,830
just an executioner
who points my blade inward?

449
00:22:01,830 --> 00:22:02,760
If word gets out,

450
00:22:02,880 --> 00:22:04,940
our fallen brothers will laugh at me.

451
00:22:07,830 --> 00:22:09,160
Feng En, remember this.

452
00:22:09,440 --> 00:22:10,400
After this stab,

453
00:22:11,160 --> 00:22:13,470
go to Hu Xing at once
and surrender to him,

454
00:22:13,680 --> 00:22:14,680
using my death

455
00:22:14,680 --> 00:22:16,140
as your pledge of loyalty.

456
00:22:18,240 --> 00:22:18,700
Come on.

457
00:22:22,830 --> 00:22:23,890
Just one step away.

458
00:22:24,400 --> 00:22:25,330
We must succeed.

459
00:22:25,640 --> 00:22:26,100
Cheers!

460
00:22:26,150 --> 00:22:26,570
Cheers!

461
00:22:26,570 --> 00:22:27,190
-Cheers!
-Cheers!

462
00:22:27,190 --> 00:22:33,380
[Shen Residence]

463
00:22:30,790 --> 00:22:31,320
Brother,

464
00:22:31,880 --> 00:22:33,010
no need to see me off.

465
00:22:33,640 --> 00:22:34,880
The medicine I just gave you

466
00:22:34,880 --> 00:22:37,110
is the same medicine
Mother gave me back then.

467
00:22:37,110 --> 00:22:38,270
For 6 hours,

468
00:22:38,270 --> 00:22:39,720
it can stop your heartbeat,

469
00:22:39,720 --> 00:22:40,790
make your body cold,

470
00:22:40,790 --> 00:22:42,590
and leave no detectable breath.

471
00:22:43,400 --> 00:22:45,400
This is how I deceived Wei Changyan.

472
00:22:46,030 --> 00:22:48,490
You can use it to deceive the coroner
as well.

473
00:22:54,070 --> 00:22:55,530
Does the wound still hurt?

474
00:22:56,160 --> 00:22:56,890
Not anymore.

475
00:22:56,960 --> 00:22:58,880
With the powder you prepared for me,

476
00:22:58,880 --> 00:23:00,480
it stopped hurting a long time ago.

477
00:23:00,480 --> 00:23:01,340
What about you?

478
00:23:01,750 --> 00:23:03,200
Have you been alright at the Xie Residence

479
00:23:03,200 --> 00:23:04,350
while I was away?

480
00:23:05,350 --> 00:23:06,030
I was fine.

481
00:23:06,400 --> 00:23:08,550
Xie Shu was keeping a close eye on me,

482
00:23:08,880 --> 00:23:10,160
but Madam Hu was seriously ill,

483
00:23:10,160 --> 00:23:12,110
so no one made things difficult for me.

484
00:23:12,110 --> 00:23:13,170
More importantly,

485
00:23:13,400 --> 00:23:15,240
I discovered the secret
of the bronze mirror.

486
00:23:15,240 --> 00:23:16,550
Madam Hu once told me

487
00:23:17,000 --> 00:23:17,920
that the mirror

488
00:23:18,110 --> 00:23:19,270
held the key to my mother's death

489
00:23:19,270 --> 00:23:20,470
and Xie Shu's secret.

490
00:23:20,790 --> 00:23:22,110
It was because of this secret

491
00:23:22,110 --> 00:23:23,970
that Xie Shu had to kill my mother.

492
00:23:24,440 --> 00:23:25,310
I investigated

493
00:23:25,310 --> 00:23:26,750
this mirror before,

494
00:23:26,920 --> 00:23:28,070
but I found nothing.

495
00:23:28,480 --> 00:23:29,480
Until that day...

496
00:23:32,400 --> 00:23:33,920
Lu Lingshu?

497
00:23:34,590 --> 00:23:35,550
Lu Lingshu?

498
00:23:37,590 --> 00:23:39,590
I've been working with Xie Shu
for so long,

499
00:23:39,590 --> 00:23:41,350
yet I've never heard of this person.

500
00:23:41,350 --> 00:23:42,310
I think I heard

501
00:23:42,750 --> 00:23:44,400
that name when I was little.

502
00:23:46,400 --> 00:23:48,480
Lady Lu even reminded us that no fires

503
00:23:49,310 --> 00:23:51,510
were allowed for 3 days
during the Cold Food Festival.

504
00:23:51,510 --> 00:23:54,030
She was afraid you and your daughter
wouldn't have enough to eat,

505
00:23:54,030 --> 00:23:56,160
so she even sent over some wheat cakes.

506
00:23:56,160 --> 00:23:58,820
I asked Xin Zhen
to ask our old neighbor about it.

507
00:23:59,350 --> 00:24:00,410
That neighbor said

508
00:24:00,510 --> 00:24:02,510
she'd never seen Lu Lingshu either.

509
00:24:02,830 --> 00:24:04,830
But the person who asked her
to take care of me

510
00:24:04,830 --> 00:24:06,760
was a nanny from the Xie Residence.

511
00:24:08,510 --> 00:24:09,480
So this person

512
00:24:10,400 --> 00:24:12,600
was very likely from the Xie Residence.

513
00:24:13,640 --> 00:24:14,110
Yes.

514
00:24:14,480 --> 00:24:15,480
But I haven't

515
00:24:15,640 --> 00:24:17,300
gotten to the bottom of it yet.

516
00:24:19,160 --> 00:24:20,480
Whoever Lu Lingshu is,

517
00:24:21,400 --> 00:24:24,000
she must be a closely guarded secret
of Xie Shu.

518
00:24:24,440 --> 00:24:25,770
If we uncover the truth,

519
00:24:26,480 --> 00:24:28,880
it could be the key
to bringing Xie Shu down.

520
00:24:29,070 --> 00:24:29,680
Dear,

521
00:24:30,410 --> 00:24:31,740
you'll have to be the one

522
00:24:31,830 --> 00:24:33,750
to strike this blow against Xie Shu.

523
00:24:33,750 --> 00:24:34,280
Alright.

524
00:24:34,750 --> 00:24:35,440
Commander,

525
00:24:35,550 --> 00:24:36,240
it's me.

526
00:24:37,110 --> 00:24:37,880
Come in.

527
00:24:40,270 --> 00:24:40,790
Feng En.

528
00:24:41,880 --> 00:24:44,110
I've already told His Majesty everything.

529
00:24:44,110 --> 00:24:45,590
He has pardoned you.

530
00:24:46,640 --> 00:24:47,300
Commander.

531
00:24:47,400 --> 00:24:47,880
Madam.

532
00:24:48,400 --> 00:24:49,550
After Marquis Li's death,

533
00:24:49,550 --> 00:24:50,510
Hu Xing and Xie Shu

534
00:24:50,510 --> 00:24:53,350
secretly ordered
2 rebel generals to gather troops.

535
00:24:53,350 --> 00:24:54,750
I'm afraid they are fully prepared

536
00:24:54,750 --> 00:24:55,720
to go to war.

537
00:24:56,680 --> 00:24:59,030
If His Lordship had stayed
at the Marquis of Danyang Residence,

538
00:24:59,030 --> 00:25:01,290
I would have risked my life to rescue him.

539
00:25:02,070 --> 00:25:03,200
But I never expected

540
00:25:03,510 --> 00:25:05,710
he would willingly attend the banquet.

541
00:25:06,160 --> 00:25:07,000
He was a hero.

542
00:25:08,350 --> 00:25:10,480
His Lordship went to the banquet
at the cost of his life,

543
00:25:10,480 --> 00:25:12,340
sacrificing himself for justice

544
00:25:12,400 --> 00:25:15,750
and using his own life
to break this suffocating balance.

545
00:25:16,350 --> 00:25:17,680
Those of us who are alive

546
00:25:18,510 --> 00:25:20,920
must continue on the path he pointed out.

547
00:25:21,590 --> 00:25:24,180
Shen Che and Dong Fangchun
are gathering refugees as planned,

548
00:25:24,180 --> 00:25:26,030
waiting for you to return and lead them.

549
00:25:26,030 --> 00:25:28,550
Zhou Peian
has also organized many students.

550
00:25:28,550 --> 00:25:29,200
Besides,

551
00:25:29,680 --> 00:25:32,540
I also secretly brought Magistrate Ye
to Hengtang.

552
00:25:32,640 --> 00:25:33,160
Good.

553
00:25:34,750 --> 00:25:35,750
It's finally time

554
00:25:35,920 --> 00:25:37,510
to start this fire.

555
00:25:42,960 --> 00:25:44,400
After all these years,

556
00:25:44,880 --> 00:25:46,480
Hengtang is still the same.

557
00:25:47,160 --> 00:25:48,920
His Majesty surely didn't expect

558
00:25:48,920 --> 00:25:50,510
that Hu Xing and Xie Shu

559
00:25:50,590 --> 00:25:52,550
have been putting on an act all along.

560
00:25:52,550 --> 00:25:54,070
What are your plans next?

561
00:25:54,400 --> 00:25:56,350
If there's anything we can help you with,

562
00:25:56,350 --> 00:25:57,350
just ask.

563
00:25:59,110 --> 00:26:00,570
Thank you, Magistrate Ye.

564
00:26:01,830 --> 00:26:02,960
For all these years,

565
00:26:03,680 --> 00:26:05,540
if you hadn't helped me in secret,

566
00:26:06,510 --> 00:26:07,910
I wouldn't be here today.

567
00:26:10,640 --> 00:26:13,100
We were inspired
by your father's dying wish

568
00:26:13,270 --> 00:26:14,920
to enter officialdom.

569
00:26:15,270 --> 00:26:16,440
Back then, he was determined to implement

570
00:26:16,440 --> 00:26:17,560
the new equalization reforms,
replacing the head tax

571
00:26:17,560 --> 00:26:19,110
with a land tax based on landholdings

572
00:26:19,110 --> 00:26:20,910
to ease the people's tax burden,

573
00:26:21,440 --> 00:26:24,700
thereby breaking
the noble families' monopoly over land.

574
00:26:25,000 --> 00:26:27,460
Now the refugees
have gathered into a force.

575
00:26:27,920 --> 00:26:29,310
Hu Xing and Xie Shu

576
00:26:29,510 --> 00:26:31,240
have already mobilized their troops,

577
00:26:31,240 --> 00:26:33,040
planning to crush them by force.

578
00:26:33,240 --> 00:26:34,550
A war is about to erupt.

579
00:26:35,160 --> 00:26:37,240
All it needs is someone to light the fuse.

580
00:26:37,240 --> 00:26:38,310
Che and I

581
00:26:38,550 --> 00:26:40,010
will light the first fire.

582
00:26:40,510 --> 00:26:42,770
Once the fire spreads through Hengtang,

583
00:26:43,200 --> 00:26:44,470
you'll add fuel to it

584
00:26:45,270 --> 00:26:46,480
in the court

585
00:26:47,440 --> 00:26:49,970
and let it spread
throughout the government.

586
00:26:50,590 --> 00:26:52,480
The court was already shaken by the death

587
00:26:52,480 --> 00:26:53,940
of the Marquis of Danyang.

588
00:26:54,310 --> 00:26:55,920
His Majesty is still watching

589
00:26:55,920 --> 00:26:57,920
and has yet to make a final decision.

590
00:26:57,920 --> 00:26:58,640
Shen Run,

591
00:26:59,270 --> 00:27:00,790
you know how unpredictable

592
00:27:00,790 --> 00:27:02,000
the court can be.

593
00:27:02,790 --> 00:27:04,920
His Majesty may secretly support you,

594
00:27:04,960 --> 00:27:06,750
but in public, he'll side with

595
00:27:07,270 --> 00:27:09,200
whichever way the wind is blowing.

596
00:27:09,400 --> 00:27:10,510
If you act now

597
00:27:10,830 --> 00:27:12,640
without absolute certainty,

598
00:27:13,070 --> 00:27:15,640
and the uprising
is successfully suppressed,

599
00:27:15,640 --> 00:27:17,040
I'm afraid it will be hard

600
00:27:17,480 --> 00:27:19,480
to predict what His Majesty will do.

601
00:27:20,750 --> 00:27:21,480
I know.

602
00:27:23,720 --> 00:27:24,920
That's why this time,

603
00:27:26,400 --> 00:27:27,480
we can only

604
00:27:28,310 --> 00:27:29,270
succeed.

605
00:27:40,400 --> 00:27:42,400
This is already the last of the soup.

606
00:27:43,000 --> 00:27:43,720
Why don't we

607
00:27:44,960 --> 00:27:46,490
split some people up first?

608
00:27:47,200 --> 00:27:50,000
Otherwise, sooner or later,
there'll be trouble.

609
00:27:52,830 --> 00:27:53,510
No.

610
00:27:53,790 --> 00:27:54,880
They lost their fields

611
00:27:54,880 --> 00:27:55,920
and homes.

612
00:27:56,270 --> 00:27:57,510
This is their last hope

613
00:27:57,510 --> 00:27:58,690
of survival.

614
00:27:59,590 --> 00:28:00,480
There's

615
00:28:01,110 --> 00:28:02,970
no turning back for Hengtang now.

616
00:28:03,880 --> 00:28:04,920
The carts are here!

617
00:28:04,920 --> 00:28:06,320
The grain carts are here!

618
00:28:08,690 --> 00:28:10,290
The grain is here!

619
00:28:10,790 --> 00:28:12,170
The grain is here!

620
00:28:12,510 --> 00:28:14,000
The grain is here!

621
00:28:15,570 --> 00:28:16,650
We have grain now!

622
00:28:17,960 --> 00:28:19,960
How did the grain turn into weapons?

623
00:28:22,960 --> 00:28:24,220
How did it turn into weapons?

624
00:28:24,220 --> 00:28:25,480
Shouldn't it be grain?

625
00:28:27,000 --> 00:28:28,060
Where is the grain?

626
00:28:34,880 --> 00:28:36,410
Isn't this Commander Shen?

627
00:28:36,550 --> 00:28:37,160
He is not dead?

628
00:28:37,160 --> 00:28:38,000
It really is him!

629
00:28:38,000 --> 00:28:39,160
-Hurry.
-Let's go.

630
00:28:40,070 --> 00:28:41,240
Let's go have a look.

631
00:28:44,510 --> 00:28:45,720
You are not mistaken.

632
00:28:46,480 --> 00:28:47,550
I am Shen Run.

633
00:28:48,070 --> 00:28:49,930
I'm here today for only one thing—

634
00:28:50,240 --> 00:28:54,240
to clear out the deep-rooted ills
that have plagued Hengtang for years.

635
00:28:54,440 --> 00:28:56,040
I believe you know my father,

636
00:28:56,310 --> 00:28:57,400
Shen Zhibai.

637
00:28:57,940 --> 00:29:05,110
[Respectfully submitted
by Your Majesty's servant, Shen Zhibai]

638
00:28:58,270 --> 00:28:59,240
Nine years ago,

639
00:28:59,790 --> 00:29:02,480
my father drafted
this Ten Suggestions on Equalization.

640
00:29:02,480 --> 00:29:03,240
He called for

641
00:29:03,790 --> 00:29:05,160
land surveys and equal taxation,

642
00:29:05,160 --> 00:29:06,080
as well as a reform of corvée labor
and grain levies,

643
00:29:06,080 --> 00:29:07,790
to save the people from hardship.

644
00:29:07,790 --> 00:29:08,790
Sadly,

645
00:29:09,640 --> 00:29:12,600
[Respectfully submitted
by Your Majesty's servant, Shen Zhibai]

646
00:29:10,960 --> 00:29:12,960
before the new policies
could even be implemented,

647
00:29:12,960 --> 00:29:14,960
he was killed by corrupt officials,

648
00:29:15,590 --> 00:29:17,590
and our entire family was wiped out.

649
00:29:18,590 --> 00:29:20,000
Only Shen Che and I

650
00:29:20,510 --> 00:29:21,400
survived.

651
00:29:24,350 --> 00:29:25,680
And what is Hengtang

652
00:29:26,110 --> 00:29:27,350
like now?

653
00:29:27,790 --> 00:29:28,790
Outside the city,

654
00:29:29,160 --> 00:29:31,240
people are starving to death faster
than their bodies can be buried.

655
00:29:31,240 --> 00:29:32,000
Inside,

656
00:29:32,400 --> 00:29:34,160
Zuixian Tavern is filled with music
and laughter every night,

657
00:29:34,160 --> 00:29:36,590
while the rich and powerful
drink and feast.

658
00:29:36,590 --> 00:29:37,720
To them,

659
00:29:39,030 --> 00:29:41,270
you're nothing
but a bunch of troublemakers.

660
00:29:41,270 --> 00:29:42,160
Your lives

661
00:29:42,590 --> 00:29:43,720
mean less to them

662
00:29:44,400 --> 00:29:46,400
than the leftovers on their tables.

663
00:29:49,400 --> 00:29:50,550
But I don't see you

664
00:29:50,830 --> 00:29:52,000
as troublemakers.

665
00:29:52,550 --> 00:29:54,510
You're ordinary people
who had your land seized

666
00:29:54,510 --> 00:29:55,710
and your homes taken,

667
00:29:55,750 --> 00:29:58,010
and were driven into becoming refugees.

668
00:29:58,720 --> 00:30:00,550
You're the people
who've suffered the most,

669
00:30:00,550 --> 00:30:01,750
borne the heaviest burden

670
00:30:01,750 --> 00:30:02,960
in this world.

671
00:30:03,680 --> 00:30:04,940
If we don't fight back,

672
00:30:05,720 --> 00:30:07,650
this suffering will be passed down

673
00:30:07,920 --> 00:30:09,680
from generation to generation.

674
00:30:09,680 --> 00:30:10,750
Now the new Emperor

675
00:30:11,030 --> 00:30:12,550
is determined to set things right,

676
00:30:12,550 --> 00:30:14,070
abolish the old ways, establish new ones,

677
00:30:14,070 --> 00:30:16,440
and vigorously implement
the equalization reforms.

678
00:30:16,440 --> 00:30:17,240
Hu Xing

679
00:30:17,750 --> 00:30:19,550
and the Xia's faction behind him

680
00:30:19,830 --> 00:30:22,160
are the last remnants standing in the way.

681
00:30:22,480 --> 00:30:23,240
I can't promise

682
00:30:23,240 --> 00:30:25,640
that every one of you
will return unharmed.

683
00:30:25,640 --> 00:30:26,770
But I can promise you

684
00:30:27,790 --> 00:30:29,650
that Hengtang will see a new dawn.

685
00:30:30,110 --> 00:30:31,710
Your children will no longer

686
00:30:32,510 --> 00:30:34,550
have to suffer from hunger and cold.

687
00:30:37,000 --> 00:30:38,030
I can promise

688
00:30:38,790 --> 00:30:40,320
that as long as we're alive,

689
00:30:40,590 --> 00:30:42,990
as long as my brothers and I
can still stand,

690
00:30:44,110 --> 00:30:46,000
we'll always stand before you.

691
00:30:48,310 --> 00:30:49,270
Those officials

692
00:30:49,440 --> 00:30:50,440
have soldiers and food.

693
00:30:50,440 --> 00:30:51,170
How can we...

694
00:30:51,200 --> 00:30:52,640
How can we possibly fight them?

695
00:30:52,640 --> 00:30:53,270
Yeah.

696
00:30:54,070 --> 00:30:54,830
How?

697
00:30:54,830 --> 00:30:56,070
They have soldiers and food.

698
00:30:56,070 --> 00:30:57,680
Can we defeat them?

699
00:30:57,680 --> 00:30:58,030
Yeah.

700
00:30:58,030 --> 00:30:59,030
How can we fight?

701
00:31:01,510 --> 00:31:02,160
We can!

702
00:31:15,480 --> 00:31:17,160
A true man is born to stand tall.

703
00:31:17,160 --> 00:31:18,960
Why not make your name live on forever?

704
00:31:18,960 --> 00:31:21,240
Even though I am but a weak scholar,

705
00:31:21,880 --> 00:31:23,410
I am willing to risk my life,

706
00:31:24,310 --> 00:31:25,070
fighting the rebels

707
00:31:25,070 --> 00:31:26,160
with all of you

708
00:31:26,830 --> 00:31:27,750
and standing with you through it all!

709
00:31:27,750 --> 00:31:28,350
And us!

710
00:31:28,830 --> 00:31:29,830
There's no coward

711
00:31:29,830 --> 00:31:31,310
in the Palace Guard Division!

712
00:31:31,310 --> 00:31:32,970
We'll follow you to the death.

713
00:31:33,030 --> 00:31:34,440
We are not afraid of Hu Xing.

714
00:31:34,440 --> 00:31:35,070
That's right!

715
00:31:35,070 --> 00:31:36,000
We'll follow the Commander!

716
00:31:36,000 --> 00:31:37,460
We'll fight that bastard!

717
00:31:37,590 --> 00:31:38,720
We'll do whatever the Commander

718
00:31:38,720 --> 00:31:39,820
orders us to do!

719
00:31:40,240 --> 00:31:40,960
Let's fight!

720
00:31:40,960 --> 00:31:41,830
Together, we fight the rebels

721
00:31:41,830 --> 00:31:42,760
and stand as one!

722
00:31:42,920 --> 00:31:44,820
Together, we fight the rebels
and stand as one!

723
00:31:44,820 --> 00:31:46,650
Together, we fight the rebels
and stand as one!

724
00:31:46,650 --> 00:31:49,250
Together, we fight the rebels
and stand as one!

725
00:32:01,240 --> 00:32:03,100
This is the second jar of aged wine

726
00:32:03,590 --> 00:32:06,050
I set aside back
in the late Emperor's reign.

727
00:32:06,350 --> 00:32:07,200
I said

728
00:32:11,960 --> 00:32:13,030
I'd open it

729
00:32:14,000 --> 00:32:15,590
at the most important

730
00:32:15,830 --> 00:32:16,400
moment.

731
00:32:18,070 --> 00:32:20,000
This jar is for you two generals.

732
00:32:25,880 --> 00:32:27,810
It's wine to send you off to battle.

733
00:32:31,110 --> 00:32:31,720
Today,

734
00:32:33,310 --> 00:32:35,040
we'll celebrate ahead of time!

735
00:32:36,720 --> 00:32:38,680
We'll march out to quell the rebellion!

736
00:32:38,680 --> 00:32:40,740
We swear to defend Hengtang's peace!

737
00:32:41,070 --> 00:32:41,790
Good!

738
00:32:42,400 --> 00:32:44,480
On behalf of the people of Hengtang,

739
00:32:44,830 --> 00:32:46,350
I thank you two generals first!

740
00:32:46,350 --> 00:32:46,810
Come on!

741
00:32:47,550 --> 00:32:48,210
Bottoms up!

742
00:33:01,910 --> 00:33:05,190
[Zhongwu Hall]

743
00:33:15,510 --> 00:33:16,840
What are you doing here?

744
00:33:18,000 --> 00:33:19,030
I'm here to see

745
00:33:21,160 --> 00:33:23,270
just how remarkable the heir

746
00:33:24,000 --> 00:33:25,640
to the Marquis of Li,

747
00:33:26,000 --> 00:33:27,830
a hero all his life, truly is.

748
00:33:30,790 --> 00:33:31,640
Turns out,

749
00:33:34,110 --> 00:33:35,370
he's just a pile of mud.

750
00:33:39,920 --> 00:33:41,640
The traitors from the Danyang Army

751
00:33:41,640 --> 00:33:44,160
are slaughtering civilians
outside the city,

752
00:33:44,160 --> 00:33:46,090
under the banner of your Li family.

753
00:33:46,830 --> 00:33:47,890
Speaking of which,

754
00:33:48,000 --> 00:33:49,070
it's truly ironic.

755
00:33:50,440 --> 00:33:51,700
This was supposed to be

756
00:33:52,200 --> 00:33:55,480
the last righteous army
your father left behind for Hengtang.

757
00:33:55,480 --> 00:33:57,880
And now it's become a weapon
for slaughter.

758
00:34:04,880 --> 00:34:07,080
I think your father must have been blind

759
00:34:08,280 --> 00:34:09,920
to place the entire hope

760
00:34:10,920 --> 00:34:11,880
of the Marquis of Danyang household

761
00:34:11,880 --> 00:34:13,840
in a useless son like you.

762
00:34:26,630 --> 00:34:28,790
Say one more word about my father

763
00:34:29,440 --> 00:34:30,639
and see what happens.

764
00:34:32,920 --> 00:34:34,110
Quite a temper.

765
00:34:35,880 --> 00:34:38,010
So you do remember who your father was.

766
00:34:39,920 --> 00:34:43,250
Then do you remember the responsibility
on your shoulders?

767
00:34:44,580 --> 00:34:48,310
[Zhongwu Hall]

768
00:34:46,190 --> 00:34:47,440
So what if I remember?

769
00:34:50,400 --> 00:34:51,400
The world

770
00:34:52,150 --> 00:34:54,480
has already rotted to its core, hasn't it?

771
00:35:03,030 --> 00:35:05,360
Wasn't your father's death proof enough?

772
00:35:07,480 --> 00:35:08,550
Then what about my father's death?

773
00:35:08,550 --> 00:35:09,810
Was that proof enough?

774
00:35:10,710 --> 00:35:12,150
If your father

775
00:35:12,510 --> 00:35:13,710
had turned a blind eye

776
00:35:14,030 --> 00:35:15,000
back then,

777
00:35:15,510 --> 00:35:18,040
perhaps your Shen family
would still be here,

778
00:35:18,070 --> 00:35:19,930
and you'd still have your father.

779
00:35:21,840 --> 00:35:22,970
But what about mine?

780
00:35:24,190 --> 00:35:26,450
If he hadn't gotten involved in all this,

781
00:35:27,510 --> 00:35:30,230
he could've stayed a Marquis peacefully!

782
00:35:31,190 --> 00:35:32,650
And he wouldn't have died.

783
00:35:39,550 --> 00:35:41,800
What happened to good men

784
00:35:42,800 --> 00:35:43,400
like them?

785
00:35:48,320 --> 00:35:50,320
They were either wrongfully killed

786
00:35:52,590 --> 00:35:54,400
or forced to their deaths.

787
00:35:59,550 --> 00:36:01,150
And who's left alive?

788
00:36:05,320 --> 00:36:07,110
People like Xie Shu

789
00:36:07,880 --> 00:36:09,110
and Hu Xing!

790
00:36:11,630 --> 00:36:14,110
And this rotten world!

791
00:36:16,480 --> 00:36:18,510
Isn't all of this proof enough?

792
00:36:18,840 --> 00:36:20,000
Isn't it enough to prove

793
00:36:20,000 --> 00:36:22,360
that this world is beyond saving?

794
00:36:33,190 --> 00:36:33,920
Congxin,

795
00:36:35,400 --> 00:36:36,200
you're wrong.

796
00:36:39,840 --> 00:36:41,670
They didn't sacrifice themselves

797
00:36:41,670 --> 00:36:44,330
because they believed Hengtang
could be saved.

798
00:36:44,590 --> 00:36:45,720
Quite the opposite.

799
00:36:47,400 --> 00:36:48,550
They knew that

800
00:36:48,550 --> 00:36:50,550
greed and evil in this world

801
00:36:51,110 --> 00:36:52,640
could never be eradicated,

802
00:36:56,320 --> 00:37:00,180
and that's precisely why they were willing
to sacrifice their lives.

803
00:37:01,190 --> 00:37:02,920
It's precisely because people

804
00:37:04,960 --> 00:37:07,000
like our fathers exist in this world

805
00:37:08,960 --> 00:37:10,670
that the nights of Hengtang

806
00:37:11,550 --> 00:37:13,000
won't lose all their light.

807
00:37:13,000 --> 00:37:15,260
Who cares about this little bit of light?

808
00:37:16,920 --> 00:37:17,510
It can't

809
00:37:17,510 --> 00:37:18,800
even light my way,

810
00:37:19,230 --> 00:37:21,160
yet it requires lives to ignite it!

811
00:37:23,070 --> 00:37:23,880
Is it worth it?

812
00:37:26,030 --> 00:37:26,760
No, it isn't.

813
00:37:47,000 --> 00:37:47,930
What did you say?

814
00:37:55,880 --> 00:37:57,210
I said it isn't worth it.

815
00:37:59,320 --> 00:38:01,050
I'm saying your father's death

816
00:38:01,760 --> 00:38:03,320
meant nothing.

817
00:38:03,550 --> 00:38:04,550
Are you satisfied

818
00:38:04,800 --> 00:38:05,800
with this answer?

819
00:38:19,000 --> 00:38:20,000
It's not worth it!

820
00:38:38,500 --> 00:38:47,400
[Zhongwu Hall]

821
00:38:49,190 --> 00:38:50,880
Ten years ago, the Marquis

822
00:38:52,840 --> 00:38:54,400
was the only one who stood up

823
00:38:54,400 --> 00:38:55,710
for my father.

824
00:38:59,630 --> 00:39:01,760
Back then, every official in Hengtang

825
00:39:03,320 --> 00:39:04,760
sang the same tune

826
00:39:05,190 --> 00:39:07,440
and pinned the blame on my father.

827
00:39:08,480 --> 00:39:09,630
Only your father

828
00:39:11,030 --> 00:39:11,960
stood up.

829
00:39:14,480 --> 00:39:15,840
In this world,

830
00:39:18,760 --> 00:39:19,890
you can seek wealth,

831
00:39:20,920 --> 00:39:22,000
fame,

832
00:39:23,510 --> 00:39:25,400
even a little justice.

833
00:39:26,880 --> 00:39:28,630
But innocence

834
00:39:29,960 --> 00:39:31,400
is something

835
00:39:33,960 --> 00:39:35,620
so many people can never have.

836
00:39:38,360 --> 00:39:39,550
Yet the Marquis,

837
00:39:40,880 --> 00:39:41,880
your father,

838
00:39:44,550 --> 00:39:45,810
gave us our innocence.

839
00:39:49,320 --> 00:39:50,510
He lit a light,

840
00:39:53,150 --> 00:39:54,610
and that light shone on me.

841
00:39:54,950 --> 00:39:58,980
[Zhongwu Hall]

842
00:40:00,190 --> 00:40:01,760
I cherish that light.

843
00:40:04,110 --> 00:40:05,310
I'm not afraid to die.

844
00:40:08,000 --> 00:40:09,150
Maybe our deaths

845
00:40:09,510 --> 00:40:10,910
won't be worth it either.

846
00:40:12,800 --> 00:40:13,730
But I believe...

847
00:40:16,150 --> 00:40:17,550
I believe that one day,

848
00:40:19,920 --> 00:40:20,710
Hengtang

849
00:40:22,670 --> 00:40:24,800
will be worthy of the word "innocent."

850
00:40:29,230 --> 00:40:29,800
Yes.

851
00:40:32,030 --> 00:40:34,190
Maybe we won't live to see that day.

852
00:40:36,800 --> 00:40:37,860
It doesn't matter.

853
00:40:39,710 --> 00:40:42,110
As long as
someone keeps walking this path,

854
00:40:44,280 --> 00:40:45,630
hope won't die,

855
00:40:47,840 --> 00:40:48,570
and the light

856
00:40:50,670 --> 00:40:51,840
will not dim.

857
00:41:04,070 --> 00:41:04,590
So what?

858
00:41:09,030 --> 00:41:10,920
So you came here

859
00:41:13,400 --> 00:41:15,400
just to tell me about

860
00:41:16,230 --> 00:41:17,290
these old stories?

861
00:41:24,760 --> 00:41:26,030
I'm here to invite you

862
00:41:28,440 --> 00:41:29,360
to join me.

863
00:41:40,800 --> 00:41:42,530
Many people are waiting for us.

864
00:41:46,110 --> 00:41:47,320
Every commoner

865
00:41:48,590 --> 00:41:49,550
is waiting.

866
00:41:52,400 --> 00:41:54,110
They are waiting for a chance,

867
00:41:57,760 --> 00:41:59,440
a chance to survive.

868
00:42:00,230 --> 00:42:01,320
This chance

869
00:42:05,030 --> 00:42:06,630
is in our hands.
